## How the two “modes” stay consistent

This is the main design choice.

```text
SiteReport  ←──  Daily log form (POST /api/site-reports/)
     ▲
     └──  Sheet cell (POST /api/projects/:id/sheet/)

Both go through ensure_day_open(project, date) first.
```

If you type `20` on Facade plaster for 31 Oct in the sheet, the Daily log for that day shows the same 20 m². Progress, forecasts and expected material on Overview and the Stock tab use the same sums. Once a manager approves 31 Oct, neither screen can change it until it is reopened.

Tasks are optional on a report. The board is for organizing work; the sheet/daily log are for measuring it. Linking a task on a report is how those worlds meet.

